A down train is now arriving at platform 3.

389
00:21:49,340 --> 00:21:49,720
Hah.

390
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:51,680
What are we going to do now?

391
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,800
We don't even have money for food anymore.

392
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:55,280
Just come back, okay?

393
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:58,000
You guys -

394
00:21:58,940 --> 00:22:00,720
We weren't betting on horses or anything.

395
00:22:00,720 --> 00:22:01,820
That's right.

396
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:04,560
Horse racing? We're not broke or anything!

397
00:22:06,080 --> 00:22:09,900
We get it, you don't have to say anything.
Just come back.

398
00:22:09,900 --> 00:22:11,800
You guys...

399
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,400
Yeah.

400
00:22:19,520 --> 00:22:21,020
That leaves only F, then.

401
00:22:21,020 --> 00:22:24,020
He shouldn't have many places left to go to.

402
00:22:24,020 --> 00:22:25,600
Hey, wait, look over there.

403
00:22:27,600 --> 00:22:28,360
There he is.

404
00:22:32,320 --> 00:22:33,220
Hey, F!

405
00:22:33,860 --> 00:22:34,760
Whoa!

406
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:38,400
What are you doing?

407
00:22:38,400 --> 00:22:40,880
Where are you going?
You came back, didn't you?

408
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:44,020
N-no, I just came to pick
up my forgotten things.

409
00:22:45,180 --> 00:22:49,140
Forgotten things? Then why don't you stay
and have some hot pot while you're here?

410
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:50,580
Hot pot?

411
00:22:50,580 --> 00:22:54,840
Yeah, we decided to celebrate our
reunion by eating duck hot pot together.

412
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:56,300
