413
00:22:57,980 --> 00:23:01,040
Fine, since it's a special occasion,
I guess I'll eat it.

414
00:23:01,040 --> 00:23:03,560
Alright, that's everyone here now.

415
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:07,200
Let's eat.

416
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:10,120
Go on, eat up.

417
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:12,120
This is delicious.

418
00:23:14,020 --> 00:23:16,840
Anyone want seconds?

419
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:19,880
Me too, me too!

420
00:23:20,700 --> 00:23:21,800
What's wrong

421
00:23:23,460 --> 00:23:25,860
It's nice that we're all together, isn't it?

422
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:32,060
Yeah, it is.

423
00:23:32,060 --> 00:23:34,060
Alright, let's make a toast. Cheers!

424
